   "title": "Delhi Police registers FIR over alleged circulation of child sexual abuse material on Meta platforms",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Delhi/delhi-police-registers-fir-over-alleged-circulation-of-child-sexual-abuse-material-on-meta-platforms/article71668968.ece",
