   "title": "Drug insecurity: Pharmacists urge Tinubu to shut open drug markets, warn of link to banditry",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/drug-insecurity-pharmacists-urge-tinubu-to-shut-open-drug-markets-warn-of-link-to-banditry/",
