   "title": "After hitting Africa’s largest economy with a trade shock, the U.S. moves to crush Chinese and Russian influence with a $625m deal in its 2nd-largest",
   "url": "https://africa.businessinsider.com/local/markets/after-hitting-africas-largest-economy-with-a-trade-shock-the-us-moves-to-block/e99hx8v",
