   "title": "Trump-backed Indian-American Vivek Ramaswamy loses Ohio Governor’s race",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-backed-indian-american-vivek-ramaswamy-loses-ohio-governors-race/article71664147.ece",
