   "title": "U.S. Midterm Elections 2026 LIVE: Democrats gain early momentum as results trickle in; Indian-American Pia Dandiya wins Florida seat",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-midterm-elections-2026-senate-governor-races-winners-lossers-live-updates-trump-republicans-democrats-news/article71660811.ece",
