   "title": "Inter-Korean cooperation on animal disease control necessary: unification minister",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261103/inter-korean-cooperation-on-animal-disease-control-necessary-unification-minister",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
