   "title": "Seoul shares open sharply lower on AI woes ahead of US midterm elections",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261103/seoul-shares-open-sharply-lower-on-ai-woes-ahead-of-us-midterm-elections",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
